---
description: Prepare one constructSequence evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: TransitionParticipant[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Build an exact dependency plan for equipment, access, transport, appointments, and acknowledgments. Identify conditions that must be ready before transfer and expose impossible timing or missing ownership rather than quietly relaxing the approved plan. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
